WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.635
Today's weather.

00:02.335 --> 00:07.962
These are today's clouds, from weather satellites that take a picture every ten minutes.

00:08.412 --> 00:12.297
A tropical storm that has a name today is marked with it.

00:12.747 --> 00:22.946
Where thunderstorms are in view over the Americas, the flashes are lightning at the rate it was measured in the last quarter of an hour, drawn larger than life.
